sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Your app
    participant SDK as Client SDK
    participant C as Your contract
    participant Chain as Host chain
    participant CoFHE as CoFHE

    Note over App,SDK: Step 1: Encrypting Input Data
    App->>SDK: Add value 5 to counter
    SDK->>SDK: encryptInputs([Encryptable.uint32(5n)])
    SDK->>CoFHE: Submit ZK proof + encrypted value
    CoFHE-->>SDK: Ciphertext handle + batch signature
    SDK->>Chain: Send transaction with handle and proof
    Chain->>C: increment(handle, proof)

    Note over C,Chain: Step 2: Performing Computations
    C->>C: Retrieve encrypted counter
    C->>C: FHE.add(encryptedCounter, encryptedValue)
    C->>Chain: Store encrypted result
    Chain-->>C: Transaction confirmed

    Note over App,CoFHE: Step 3: Retrieving Encrypted Output
    App->>SDK: Read counter value
    SDK->>Chain: Request encrypted counter
    Chain->>C: getCounter(userAddress)
    C-->>SDK: ctHash (encrypted handle)

    SDK->>SDK: Build an ACP carrying the sealing key
    SDK->>CoFHE: decryptForView(ctHash, FheTypes.Uint32)
    CoFHE->>CoFHE: Seal the result to the ACP's sealing key
    CoFHE-->>SDK: Sealed result
    SDK->>SDK: Unseal locally
    SDK-->>App: Counter value: 5
